  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IIPSA Technical Appraisal Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The proposed Technical Assistance (TA) will support the selection process (the Project Selection Committee) for a credible IIPSA project pipeline arising from the Call for Expression of Interest. It would further support the NT and EU for the funds allocated to the CEI, and would support the implementation and management of this component, which will include logistical and technical support of the approved projects as well as reporting to the EUD, National Treasury and the Project Steering Committee. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
